{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_06",
  "title": "傳說",
  "storyCode": "IW-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bcc72199f7a038bb7adfc6c6d029b2f57a6dfaed1c04ed8ed931d94db88b04f9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "......沒看到掌櫃的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "沒看到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "怎麼回事，哪家店都找不到掌櫃的，終於想通了，回家享清福了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "但願吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "......怎麼了劉二，心情不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "好，好得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "怎麼不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "——你這身手，土石法術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "正是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "只可惜你一身功夫，卻不知善用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你方才飛沙裹手，打裂我的扁擔，這是什麼鬼掌法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......吃我一掌，只是微微寸裂，如此扁擔，反倒稀奇，有何來歷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我用的只是尋常青竹扁擔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "那我使的便是毫無章法之掌法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你叫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "太合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好，了不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "能在最後和你這樣的高手過上兩招，不虧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你是當官的吧，告訴我，你們在做的事，這隻酒盞的事，是在圖謀什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "謀天下萬世昌寧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......哈哈，好大口氣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "只可惜，這東西還是不能給你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "你逃無可逃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "——想走！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "挑山人向後躍出一步。\n十年登山，千百萬步中的一步。\n風箏斷線，風起而身動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......唔，你方才藏了身法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "在山上，你追不上我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "太合，告訴那個小子，取江峰峰頂，忘水坪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "莫忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......太合叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "沒追上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "若捨身相追，並非難事。只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "他要以酒盞為威脅，逼鄭掌櫃與他相見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "峰頂忘水坪，二者相見，必死其一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......沒有餘地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "方才交手，知根知底，絕無餘地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......峰頂忘水坪是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "得搶佔先機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......幸好沒和那個挑山人起什麼衝突，看那身手，都讓我想起十幾年前最後一次見到槐天裴的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你認識那兩個人，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......我說過，爹是領了朝廷密令，那兩個人，就是朝廷的信使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "知道身份嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "只知道那個領頭的大塊頭，是肅政院的大官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我心裡有數了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "雖然本不想麻煩羅德島......但看來，還是得借他們的力量......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，不過這下可麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "雖然沒聽見他們在說什麼，但看他們急匆匆離開的方向，多半是向山頂去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我和羅德島約定的碰頭地點，也是山頂。如此一來，究竟場面會變成什麼樣，就沒人知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那我們先一步埋伏在山頂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "別了吧，都是高手，自討苦吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那你說怎麼辦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——等等！快，躲過來點，別抬頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "是掌櫃的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹怎麼在這兒......？而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你臉色很白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "他......他拿著的是他的刀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不，這麼多年......他從來沒拿過他的刀......他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "掌櫃的是個刀客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......以前是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那看來現在也是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "情況不妙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "越往山頂，路越窄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "就快到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......這是最後一條路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "最後一條路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "離了這個鎮子，向西走幾步，能看到一條長長的階梯山道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "走到頂，就是忘水坪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......在這遇到，真是太碰巧了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "確實趕巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你們在追什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "酒盞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "在山頂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......隱瞞也沒意思了，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "而且在一個局外人身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......那隻酒盞到底是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "告訴你了，克洛絲姐姐就會幫我們搶回它嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你們的目的可不只是“搶回來”這麼簡單，你們明顯要利用它做些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "而我猜，其實你們的目的和鯉先生一樣，都是要找出這隻酒盞的主人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那你們何必多此一舉呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "克洛絲姐姐這是疑問，還是......質問？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "怎麼會是質問呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這隻酒盞，是一位大罪人製造的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "罪人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "彌天大罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "朝堂秘聞，莫要打探。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "而你們要利用一個彌天罪人的東西，做些和羅德島幹員有關的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不告訴我，我怎麼幫忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人說的沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "雖說身份有別，但托人辦事，從來沒有語焉不詳的道理。俗話說得好，人心隔肚皮，不坦誠相待，怕是處理不好這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我還擔心你迷路了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "啊哈哈，恩人明鑑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......你還把她們當成你們的“幹員”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年沉默不語。\n作為最年輕的司歲台秉燭人，他必須要權衡利弊，做出選擇。\n這不是什麼驚為天人的秘密。\n但他不希望事情出現任何差池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......這隻酒盞裡寄宿著一匹凶獸。當然，只是他意識的部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "我自有分寸，若是之後司歲台怪罪下來，太合叔也不必念人情，依法處置便是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "寄宿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "當代巨獸學家普遍認為，除了以某種形式凝出肉身實體，行走大地之外，這些古老巨物，也有手段寄宿於一些物件之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "古籍常言，“獸與厚土行”，其實點出了這些生物的特性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......呃，什麼物件都行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "比較常見的是兵器。無論是古代薩卡茲的刀劍，還是如今工業產物下的法杖，都有案例。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "只是具體原理，尚不明晰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那麼那隻酒盞也是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "所到之處，器倀四起。雖然還不能確定，但是我們有理由懷疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "酒盞是活的，卻沒有活動起來。它周圍的物件是死的，卻會因它而活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這隻酒盞流落許久，我們也是因為某個偶然，才定位到它的位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "所以你們要找到那個罪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "我剛才說了，製造它的，是一位罪人。可如今它的主人，則是另一位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "一個詩人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......梁大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "今天風大，日落得早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "早也不早，不知不覺就這個時辰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "爬一座山，要多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "古時，尚蜀山巒，人力不能及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "蜀道難，難於上青天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......如今不同了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "可再如何不同，有些事情，不變就是不變的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "三山十七峰，處處尋不得。梁大人還要再找嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "得找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "不惜瞞天過海，騙過我，騙過所有人也得找？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "得找的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你難道不知道，縱使有千番道理，逾矩便是逾矩，犯忌便是犯忌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你難道不知道，此事出了一點差池，別說前程不保，論起罪責，你首當其衝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你難道不知道......我是願意聽你說的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "所以我更不能告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......為何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "因為梁某人身為一城之知府，只考慮一城之安危性命。一磚一瓦，一爐一灶，但凡有絲毫損毀，便是我的失職。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "上峰齟齬，梁某人所能做的......唯有勉力而行而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......早年初會尚蜀，見你雖偶爾固執古板，但畢竟剛正不阿，一身正氣。我一直堅信，你我共事，定能跨過千難萬阻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "可如今......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......我卻難免有些失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......這句話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是作為梁某人的朋友寧小姐提醒梁某人呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......還是作為朝廷從二品欽差大員，禮部左侍郎寧辭秋，敲打梁某人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
